Licences of the data in this repository's releases

1. Railway lines (rail-blocks.pmtiles, rail-blocks.idx)

   Derived from OpenStreetMap data (railway ways from the Overpass API,
   2026-10-03), simplified to 0.2 m.
   © OpenStreetMap contributors.
   This database is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
   Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
   Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/
   OpenStreetMap copyright and licence: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

2. Time zones (in core_ref.db)

   Derived from timezone-boundary-builder (timezones-with-oceans-1970, 2026d),
   simplified to 1 km.
   © OpenStreetMap contributors, timezone-boundary-builder
   (https://github.com/evansiroky/timezone-boundary-builder).
   Made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

3. Countries, disputed areas, admin-1 regions and cities
   (core_ref.db, geo-*.db.gz)

   Derived from Natural Earth 1:10m (admin-0 countries, admin-0 disputed areas,
   admin-1 states and provinces, populated places), version 5.1.1.
   Natural Earth data is in the public domain: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

4. Railway stations (stations.db.gz)

   Derived from OpenStreetMap data (railway=station and railway=halt nodes,
   ways and relations from the Overpass API, 2026-10-06).
   © OpenStreetMap contributors.
   This database is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
   Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
   Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

5. Airports (in core_ref.db)

   From OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/, 2026-10-06), which
   releases its data to the public domain.

6. Road networks (road-main-blocks.pmtiles, road-street-blocks.pmtiles and
   their .idx indexes, road-countries.json), since data-2

   Derived from OpenStreetMap data (country extracts of Switzerland and Italy
   from Geofabrik, https://download.geofabrik.de/, 2026-10-08): the roads
   motor vehicles may use, split at junctions and simplified to 1 m.
   © OpenStreetMap contributors.
   This database is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
   Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
   Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/
   OpenStreetMap copyright and licence: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The ODbL-licensed databases above are published here in full, as the app uses
them.
